# Root repo hygiene
outputs/

# Keep only the top-level repo guidance docs
!README.md
!AGENTS.md
!STYLE-CHARLAS.md

# Ignore everything inside talk folders by default
Harness Engineer/**
Evolucion Stack Clasico DS/**
El Eterno Retorno/**

# Re-include only the publishable structure per talk
!Harness Engineer/
!Harness Engineer/README.md
!Harness Engineer/*.pptx
!Harness Engineer/notes/
!Harness Engineer/notes/**

!Evolucion Stack Clasico DS/
!Evolucion Stack Clasico DS/README.md
!Evolucion Stack Clasico DS/*.pptx
!Evolucion Stack Clasico DS/notes/
!Evolucion Stack Clasico DS/notes/**

!El Eterno Retorno/
!El Eterno Retorno/README.md
!El Eterno Retorno/*.pptx
!El Eterno Retorno/notes/
!El Eterno Retorno/notes/**

# Explicit technical artifacts to keep out even if structure changes
**/slides/
**/slides/**
**/assets/
**/assets/**
**/validation/
**/validation/**
**/artifact-build-manifest.json
